# Default `go build ./...` output in this directory: a 24MB binary named after
# the package directory. Nothing consumes it; the real bundle is /build/bin/.
# Windows appends .exe to that name, which this list did not cover, so a build
# run there was committable — and was committed. Both spellings now.
/desktop
/desktop.exe
